Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.94,0:00:09.94,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\fs(60)\pos(960,680)\fad(0,850)}Some-Stuffs Presents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This senior gentleman seems familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We definitely know that\Nupright bearing in that scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again, Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.11,0:00:19.12,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an(6)\pos(1691,535)\fad(700,600)}Original Translation:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.11,0:00:19.12,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an(6)\pos(1690,587)\fad(700,600)}Mudasubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand you're an\NAmerican oil tycoon now.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.49,0:00:23.50,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an6\fad(700,600)\pos(1684,187)}Timing:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.49,0:00:23.50,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an6\pos(1682,240)\fad(700,600)}Fadeout4
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a bit exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look as young as ever straight, so.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.67,0:00:28.67,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fad(700,600)\pos(243,732)}Typesetting:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.67,0:00:28.67,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fad(700,600)\pos(243,786)}Fadeout4
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe we're the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamon energy is life energy, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.30,0:00:34.80,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an(6)\pos(1684,687)\fad(700,600)}Editor:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.30,0:00:34.80,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an(6)\pos(1684,735)\fad(700,600)}Tonitonichopchop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been half a century since\NJonathan Joestar made his sacrifice.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.47,0:00:39.47,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fad(700,600)\pos(242,453)}Quality Check:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.47,0:00:39.47,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fad(700,600)\pos(242,508)}Mazrim
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.97,0:00:43.98,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an(6)\pos(1685,558)\fad(700,600)}Encoding:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.97,0:00:43.98,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an(6)\pos(1681,612)\fad(700,600)}Fadeout4
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straitzo has succeeded Master Tonpetty,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while Speedwagon has had\Nsuccess building a fortune.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.69,0:00:50.40,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fad(500,600)\pos(252,551)}Raw Hunter:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.69,0:00:50.40,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fad(500,600)\pos(252,606)}WRRRRY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, they're headed\Nfor Mexico to see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This something was discovered by a\NSpeedwagon-funded exploration team.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:55.91,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fad(500,600)\pos(242,470)}Distro:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:55.91,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fad(500,600)\pos(242,523)}ExWizzard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:01:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, it's a secret\Nknown only to these select few.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.90,0:01:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tell you, Straitzo, once you\Nlay eyes on this, I believe, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am certain you'll feel a chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's frightful enough to make even\Nyour disciplined hair stand on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find it even worse\Nthan the terror we faced
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fifty years ago when we\Nall battled with Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.82,0:01:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how large this space is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is the reason we came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.95,0:01:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stone mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there are so many of them!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.66,0:01:44.00,Credits_Episode_10,,0,0,0,,{\fs(62)\an2\fad(650,0)\pos(960,947)}http://www.some-stuffs.com/
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.75,0:01:48.92,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fs88\fad(680,0)\fscx105\pos(960,805)\bord3\blur2}1938 New York
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.75,0:01:48.92,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\be(1)\fs(88)\fad(680,0)\fscx(105)\pos(960,805)}1938 New York
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was in the fall of 1938.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.14,0:01:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was doing my job,\Njust like I always did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eyes peeled for Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.06,0:01:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really never heard\Nof this fine beverage?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By your accent, I'd say\Nyou're in from England.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tourist, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make the big city your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you want a drink, you're\Ngonna have to lay down some shekels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cash is the king around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nerve of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna let that\NMega steal your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.46,0:02:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a patsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was easy as pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I finally caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red-handed, you punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.58,0:02:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing on my feet, you trash?
