Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make sure they\Nlock you up for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy. Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only pinched a wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate bottom feeders like\Nyou preying on the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But see, I'm nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:02:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do you a solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:03:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna let you bring me $20 every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also half of everything you glommed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the pigeon what\Ngot his wallet lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is evidence, so\NI'm gonna be keeping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, how shall I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There actually is no crime since\Nthat wallet was a gift, Constable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this six and a half foot giant of\Nan Englishman was covering for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, sir, would you please\Nreturn both wallet and boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I said, it was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.34,0:03:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and I are good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him go, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good friend
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.86,0:03:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why don't you tell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.56,0:03:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me what your good friend's name is?
