Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were shot resisted arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, try to shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I am warning you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you can pull the trigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will have broken your finger\Nlike a rotten matchstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not from over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll blow your damn brains out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, his body started to\Ngive off some sort of glow.
