Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The soda cap blew off\Nand flew as fast as a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bullet straight over to\Nsnap the cop's finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I gave in to my temper again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, I'm in for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Granny Arena's going to be furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She beat down two cops but\Nis scared of his grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny Arena will understand\Nif I explain, won't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pickpocket, what say we\Nhightail it on out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't know exactly how he launched\Nthe bottle cap with such force.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he could always\Ndo things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his grandpa could do the same kind of\Nthings, but he died at a young age.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His dad, who died in the war,\Ndidn't have any talents like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His mom was gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really owe you big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone calls me Smokey, and I'd sure\Nlike it if you'd tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.35,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fscx88\fs210\b1\pos(960,870)}BATTLE TENDENCY
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.35,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fs164\b1\pos(958,890)}BATTLE TENDENCY
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.35,0:06:21.98,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1127,859)\blur1}Episode 10: "New York's JoJo"
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.35,0:06:21.98,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\be(1)\pos(1127,859)}Episode 10: "New York's Jojo"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends call me Jojo.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.94,0:06:20.81,Main,Joseph,0,0,0,,{\an8}But you can call me JoJo. {Toni, I can't decide if this line should be on the top or bottom! :( -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.94,0:06:20.81,Main,Joseph,0,0,0,,{\an8}But you can call me Jojo. {Toni, I can't decide if this line should be on the top or bottom! :( -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that a carving of on that pillar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a carving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has amino acids, proteins, and cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though it's faint, he\Nhas body heat and a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.82,0:06:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are looking at a living man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Straizo, understand who he\Nis, how long he's been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how he got there in the first\Nplace, what the masks are for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are here for one purpose only.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:06:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought you because\Nof your hormone ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you can use it to utterly destroy\Nhim while he slumbers in this stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Joseph Joestar? Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar, how is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear he has Hamon ability\Nand saved your life once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why bring up Jojo now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I recall, he was but 13\Nyears of age at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, quite young.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your plane was hijacked by criminals\Nwho wanted to hold you for ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stay back here, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up front!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hijacking the plane and\Nkidnapping Speedwagon, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am only a bystander.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is his problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to read my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your business and\Njust leave me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong answer, punk! Now move! Jojo!
