Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Harmon? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did that crazy kid do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run the controls!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't fly, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, get the pilot ready,\Nwe're going to jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you ever just\Nthink things through, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mostly about how to best keep\Nyou and Granny Iran safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are the only family that I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may have his grandfather's face,\Nbut he's far from being a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the day I discovered that\NJoseph was able to use Hamon. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,young Joseph inherited the ability to\Ncontrol Hamon from his grandfather Jonathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why are you speaking of him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.34,0:09:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just took the lives of all these men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when you lose your life, Jonathan's\Ngrandson will know grief and anger and hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will develop a\Ntremendous hatred for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Straitzo!
