Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straitzo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your senses? I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, my thinking is extremely clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I chose Harmon to forge my body\Ninto something pure and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as I trained, the aging of my\Nflesh became painfully clear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harmon provides only a small\Nadvantage over ordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It cannot guard against\Nthe process of aging.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the battle we fought so many\Nyears ago, I secretly admired Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was powerful.
