Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I coveted the power\Ngranted by the Stone Mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.12,0:10:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't care who got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:11:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a twisted traitor, Straizo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your blood will now bring me immortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With you gone, the only ones to know of\Nthe Mask will be Iran and Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once I have disposed of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall learn more of the\Nmask than Dio ever could.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The knowledge you're seeking\Ncould have terrible consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, Joe, breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get a clue\Nwhat you're doing, dumbass?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull your head out of your\Nbutt and see where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get the hell out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there! What? Didn't hear that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't make it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind repeating all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know what\Nit was you meant to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.40,0:12:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case I have to pound you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.94,0:12:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, what is it you're doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny Arena I asked what\Nyou're doing with that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see This man is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A taxi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way you don't have to walk so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jojo. You're\Nsuch a thoughtful boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Climb in, Smokey. We're going for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestar family Reduced to\Na grandmother And her grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over time, I would hear\Nbits of their past.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon sent for us, and we came all the\Nway to New York simply because he asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now we find he's not even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think his behavior is quite rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that the oil business\Nrequires much of his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Granny, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was Speedwagon really\NGrandpa's best friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all it was? Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you implying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was never married, was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.90,0:13:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you yourself are a widow. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it leads me to wonder\Nif simple friendship was
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only relationship\Nthat was going on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rogue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wrong! Ow! Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.82,0:13:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Speedwagon is loyal! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestars tended to be short-lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny Arena lost her husband\Nin an accident at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was pregnant with a son at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he grew up, he married a girl\Nwho would also survive the wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were JoJo's parents. Later\Nclaimed by war and disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.88,0:14:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny Arena was a gentle and giving woman,\Neven to punks like me, or anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was because she\Nlived with loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo was the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.46,0:14:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, however, his basic\Nkindness got him into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, waiter! Waiter! Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.24,0:14:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who decided that stinking animal\Ncould be allowed in here, huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His smell is ruining my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind shouldn't be\Nallowed in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's a policy\Nhanded down by management.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as the check is paid in full,\Nwe happily serve anyone. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll happily let beasts like\Nthat do their grazing in here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just be on my way.
