Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.90,0:14:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.82,0:14:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to tell\Nme to stop, are you? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are entitled to their opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this misbegotten oaf has\Ngiven public insult to our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be mindful of the other guests\Nnow, but teach him a lesson.
