Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, boy, looking to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the brass knuckles are\Nwhat you're looking for,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are not going to find\Nthem inside of your coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might want to check your\Nback pocket instead. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next you'll say, you bastard, how could\Nyou have possibly known where they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard, how could you possibly\Nhave known where they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the visible abrasions\Nthat are on your right hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's obvious that you do your\Nfighting using brass knuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:16:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've no wounds, so the blood\Non your shirt is not from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you've just come from a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the blood is on your shirt\Nand not that pink horror of a coat,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was taken off prior to the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, after you had\Ncompleted your assault,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the knuckles came off, and that's\Nwhen you proceeded to stow them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in your back pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For my next glimpse into the future, you\Nwill now say, So what, you little punk?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.46,0:16:25.50,SFXOang2,13,0,0,0,,{=98}{\blur6\bord4.71\fscx61.18\fscy47.06\frz4.627\alpha&H80&\pos(1413.76,634.61)}Bam
