Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you been punching?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't the one you were\Npummeling so happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.22,0:16:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can predict and counter anything your\Ntiny brain is able to come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand that now, you simpleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, forgive the behavior\Nof my underling, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Arena Joestar, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.52,0:17:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've worked on a lot of\Nbusiness deals with your Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me some stories about you when\Nhim and me were in London a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.26,0:17:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard a little something\Nthrough the grapevine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hasn't made it into the\Npapers yet, but you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon has been murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.26,0:17:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumor is the cat who did it\Nwas some sort of Tibetan monk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some sort of monk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.86,0:17:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be straighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All they're saying is that the\Nbodies of Speedwagon and his
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,team washed up along a riverbank\Nsomewhere down in Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.60,0:17:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a genuine mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody has any idea why they were killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or where the monk might\Nhave gone to afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think I might know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.36,0:18:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon said something a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It involved Dio, and the horrible\Nstone mask that changed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, that guy is a mafia man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.18,0:18:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't trust what he tells you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to pull something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe whatever you want to, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.34,0:18:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try your breast pocket if\Nyou're after your lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, thanks for the warning, Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think I believe what\Nthis man is telling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These fellows are only\Nmotivated by money. Clearly,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,information like that is\Nvaluable to his organization,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm inclined to listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However...
