Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.22,0:18:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As true as that may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't simply waltz over here and then\Njust blurt out awful news to Granny Iran.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see how badly upset\Nyou've made her with this news?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:18:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are very thoughtless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:19:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was 50 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and still, those events haunt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here, and I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm concerned for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you snared by\Nevil from a half-century ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is my fate, I accept it fully.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.72,0:19:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the time, I didn't\Nunderstand what was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But these two had an unimaginable history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See what they're saying? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think this is true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can girls really make them bigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go from a double A cup to a C cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.21,0:20:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bunch of snake oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't buy into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come again?
