Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, yes, but
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say, you look rather familiar\Nto me, yet somehow different?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.82,0:20:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me, have we\Npossibly met somewhere before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why isn't your breath\Nvisible? It's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.62,0:20:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tonight and if my eyes\Naren't deceiving me i think I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,caught a glimpse of fangs\Nin your mouth just now
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was i seeing things
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:20:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trifle with me i warn you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.64,0:21:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it is in plain sight\Non the city street Jojo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take your life long before\Nyou ever become a danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps not.
