Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.60,0:21:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was awaiting you, Straizo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was on behalf of Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't think you'll\Ngo down so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.62,0:21:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our war has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.96,0:22:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.\NThe words will make
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.35,0:22:14.93,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.93,0:22:18.48,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You out and out. I'll\Nspend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.48,0:22:23.82,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.54,0:22:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning, driving through\Nthe sun. And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.82,0:22:26.49,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.49,0:22:30.95,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing They make the
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.46,0:22:42.04,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.04,0:22:45.63,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.82,0:22:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,children really ring I\Nspend the day your way
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.63,0:22:50.93,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.80,0:22:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning, driving through\Nthe sun. And in and out the valley
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.93,0:22:53.56,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.56,0:22:57.60,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.26,0:22:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.60,0:22:59.98,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.04,0:23:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the\Nsky. And they stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.27,0:23:03.48,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.23,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.14,0:23:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mile over, we'll be\Nthere And we'll see you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.40,0:23:12.07,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.48,0:23:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten true summers, we'll\Nbe there Laughing with you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.83,0:23:18.50,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.04,0:23:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four, we'll be there. But\NI will say I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.29,0:23:24.96,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty-four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.96,0:23:26.96,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,There with you
